                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2611.12527/2611.12527v1/wavegen_fig.png",
                "caption": "Figure 1:E2E text-to-waveform diffusion training details. We reshape high-resolution waveform signals (24,000 Hz) into a low-resolution space (100 Hz) for efficient E2E waveform diffusion. Then, we introduce Spectral Forcing for internal spectral guidance and simply concatenate average-upsampled text embeddings. We use shared DiT blocks for text-speech alignment and disentangled DiT heads for representation refinement. We adoptxx-prediction as the prediction space, andvv-loss as the target loss space, and introduce a new multi-scalevv-space spectral loss",
